      <p>We're Ben and Em, qualified electricians who are passionate about doing things properly, safely, and to the highest possible standard. Our business is built on care, attention to detail, and pride in our work. Whether it's a small repair or a full domestic installation, we approach every job with the same mindset: thorough planning, safe practices, and clean, precise workmanship. We're known for being particular, because we believe your home deserves nothing less.</p>
      <p>We specialise in residential electrical work and understand how important it is to feel comfortable with the people working in your home. As new parents ourselves, we truly appreciate the trust families place in us. Having a female electrician on the job also helps us create a welcoming, respectful environment, especially for single females and families who want added peace of mind.</p>
      <p>We hold ourselves to a very high standard, not just in our electrical work but in how we communicate, show up on time, and treat your home as if it were our own. Safety isn't just a requirement for us, it's a value.</p>
      <p>If you're looking for electricians who genuinely care, take pride in their craft, and put people first, we'd love to work with you.</p>
